  "bindingContract": "Fixture-only domain data, not a claimed MCP scenario schema or AST/scope encoding. It preserves all seven v2 scenarios and adds four state-permission cases. candidatePool is the complete raw candidate set after the legacy owner/controller/core/passability/population/industry/actor-registry gates and before the proposed permission helper; no other eligible candidate is modeled. Every state record explicitly supplies owner, controller, cores, impassable status, population, all scored industrial getters, capital, live center flag, center registry membership, adjacency, live Event 34 conversion-forbidden flag, and center episode metadata. A greatDepressionCenterEpisodeId of -1 means optional episode metadata is unknown/not applicable and is not itself an exclusion. A flagged center is reserved to another active episode unless an explicit inherited seed is for the same actorActiveEpisodeId. The Event 34 frozen conversion proof applies only when greatDepressionRegionCallConversionForbidden is true and recipientSourceStateId exactly matches event34SnapshotRegionStateId; it does not exclude an arbitrary state. actorCenterRegistryStateIds is complete for the receiving actor. Translate only through verified live MCP schema; otherwise retain this as an unresolved analyzer input."
}
